# why their laptop was running tests: load average 101 on 14 cores, two full suites from
# one session. Every new repo reaches for `pytest` in a verify.sh because it is the
# obvious thing to type, and nothing noticed. "Anything a check could enforce is a gate,
# not prose" — this is that gate, and it is what makes the runner the DEFAULT for repos
